menuconfig HRM
    bool "Heart Rate Monitor"
    help
      Heart Rate Monitor Drivers

if HRM

config HRM_GH3X2X
    bool "Goodix GH3X2X"
    help
      Support for the Goodix GH3X2X heart rate sensor.

config HRM_VC31
    bool "Vcare VC31/VC31B"
    help
      Interface-only support for the Vcare VC31/VC31B optical heart-rate sensor.
      Powers the part and reads raw registers; the PPG->BPM algorithm is a
      proprietary blob and is not implemented.

